Modifications by Lattice Systems LLC: the git provider was ported from the
MCP server to a standalone command-line program. The MCP server, dependency
injection, request-context logging and OpenTelemetry wrapper were removed;
imports were rewritten for the standalone layout; write operations are gated
by a per-method policy check (dry-run, read-only, confirmation) before any git
command is built; errors are mapped to the CLI's JSON error envelope.

